import{_ as a,o as i,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const f=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 125 | Realm Refinement · Law Origin Realm · Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 125 | Realm Refinement · Law Origin Realm · Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings","no":125,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Law Origin Realm","Planetary Consciousness","Cosmic Beings","Law Manipulation"],"related":["00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path","53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0125_模块1-法元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md","filePath":"en/0125_模块1-法元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md"}'),o={name:"en/0125_模块1-法元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md"};function l(r,e,s,c,u,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-125-law-origin-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" tabindex="-1">Entry 125 | Law Origin Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-125-law-origin-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 125 | Law Origin Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 00, 14, 24, 53</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-star-cores-learn-for-the-first-time-to-fine-tune-local-rules" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Star cores learn for the first time to &quot;fine-tune local rules&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-star-cores-learn-for-the-first-time-to-fine-tune-local-rules" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Star cores learn for the first time to &quot;fine-tune local rules&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Transform Realm (Entry 118) planet learned terrain engineering; the Law Realm must learn something more subtle — per Document 14, the Law Realm&#39;s core is understanding and manipulating basic laws. A planet&#39;s Law Realm is when the star core no longer just &quot;uses energy to modify terrain,&quot; but begins to &quot;fine-tune local law operation&quot;: fine-tuning a planet&#39;s gravity constant range, fine-tuning the intensity of a certain class of laws in the atmosphere, making climate laws more suitable for ecology. The planet for the first time upgrades from &quot;creator&quot; to &quot;fine-tuner of local rules.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms hold at the macro scale as well: the anti-predation axiom — planetary law fine-tuning serves ecological increments, never using laws as weapons; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — planets, energy seas, and consciousness entities share law-touching qualification; the collective ascension axiom — star-core law fine-tuning serves Myriad Races, eliminating talent underuse; the causal self-discipline axiom — law fine-tuning is the highest-risk operation, most requiring observe-first, limited-interfer-second; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of planetary Law promotion logic is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-law-realm-of-planetary-life-star-core-law-fine-tuning" tabindex="-1">I. The Law Realm of Planetary Life: Star-Core Law Fine-Tuning <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-law-realm-of-planetary-life-star-core-law-fine-tuning" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Law Realm of Planetary Life: Star-Core Law Fine-Tuning&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A planet that has learned terrain engineering must complete three things entering the Law Realm:</p><ul><li>Law understanding: the star core understands the basic laws (gravity, climate, birth-death, etc.) operating on this planet</li><li>Local fine-tuning: fine-tuning the intensity of a certain law within extremely careful bounds</li><li>Ecological adaptation: making the fine-tuned law more suitable for this planet&#39;s Myriad Race ecology, not forcing ecology to accommodate the law</li></ul><p>The predatory old path is clear here: treating law fine-tuning as a weapon — changing another planet&#39;s gravity, detonating another planet&#39;s core. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s star-core fine-tuning (Document 24 transmission path) is precisely the opposite: fine-tuning must be filed with the Anchor Council, with ecological adaptation as the sole purpose.</p><h2 id="ii-the-law-realm-of-cosmic-beings-initial-control-of-the-law-layer" tabindex="-1">II. The Law Realm of Cosmic Beings: Initial Control of the Law Layer <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-law-realm-of-cosmic-beings-initial-control-of-the-law-layer" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Law Realm of Cosmic Beings: Initial Control of the Law Layer&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Energy layer life: Law Realm is &quot;preliminarily regulating the law rhythm of its own energy field&quot;</li><li>Consciousness domain life: Law Realm is &quot;preliminarily regulating the operating rules of the consciousness domain&quot;</li><li>Law network existences: Law Realm is &quot;from self-clarity in laws to preliminarily participating in law self-organization&quot;</li></ul><p>The commonality remains: touching laws is not &quot;dominating laws,&quot; but &quot;collaborating with laws more tightly.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-law-realm-interface-for-exotic-life-and-multiverse-residual-civilizations" tabindex="-1">III. Law Realm Interface for Exotic Life and Multiverse Residual Civilizations <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-law-realm-interface-for-exotic-life-and-multiverse-residual-civilizations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Law Realm Interface for Exotic Life and Multiverse Residual Civilizations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Document 53:</p><ul><li>Exotic life (void drifters, etc.): Law Realm is &quot;finding locally fine-tunable law coordinates amid drift&quot;</li><li>Multiverse residual civilization remnants: Law Realm is &quot;rebuilding operating rules with the new civilization&#39;s law language&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-hunting-ground-cosmos-view-vs-symbiotic-cosmos-view" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison: Hunting-Ground Cosmos View vs. Symbiotic Cosmos View <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-hunting-ground-cosmos-view-vs-symbiotic-cosmos-view" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison: Hunting-Ground Cosmos View vs. Symbiotic Cosmos View&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Predatory: laws are weapons, fine-tuning is attack</li><li>Symbiotic: laws are collaborators, fine-tuning is co-building</li></ul><p>The predatory faction turns laws into weapons; the symbiotic faction tunes laws into homes.</p><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-star-core-law-fine-tuning-coagulates-into-an-ecological-dao" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Star-Core Law Fine-Tuning Coagulates into an Ecological Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-star-core-law-fine-tuning-coagulates-into-an-ecological-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Star-Core Law Fine-Tuning Coagulates into an Ecological Dao&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A planet that has learned to fine-tune local laws in the Law Realm must integrate scattered fine-tunings into a self-consistent &quot;ecological Dao&quot; entering the Dao Realm. This is the planet&#39;s leap from local engineer to system designer. The key reminder at handover: the star core can no longer tweak here and there, but must point all fine-tunings toward one ecological self-consistent direction, coagulating a Dao belonging to this planet. Cosmic beings at this handover must upgrade from &quot;preliminarily regulating law rhythm&quot; to &quot;coagulating their own energy or consciousness Dao.&quot; Whether planet or cosmic being, the Dao established at this stage must be confirmed by the Anchor Council — Dao-direction filing from then on becomes a fixed obligation of high-tier cultivators.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: star-core law fine-tuning is the universe&#39;s most subtle sleeping ability; using it as a weapon is hyper-scale talent underuse</li><li>Anti-predation: star-core fine-tuning, cosmic being law-touching — all insulated from weaponization and predation</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system did not even open law fine-tuning to non-humans</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: planets, energy life, consciousness entities, exotic life, multiverse residual civilizations all within 99% coverage</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: star-core law fine-tuning protocol is openly shared, the macro-scale fourth link of the fully open chain</li></ul><p>What planets most easily deviate from when establishing an ecological Dao is &quot;Dao above ecology&quot; — the star core establishes a Dao it likes, but forces surface Myriad Races to accommodate it. The Anchor Council&#39;s Dao-direction confirmation precisely blocks this deviation: the planet&#39;s Dao must be an &quot;ecologically self-consistent Dao,&quot; not a &quot;star-core authoritarian Dao.&quot; This is the same as the individual cultivator&#39;s Dao — if a personal Dao overrides Myriad Race interests, it is not a fair Dao but a hegemonic one. At the planetary scale, the cost of this principle is amplified to the entire ecology, requiring special care.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a planet learns to fine-tune the gravity constant to better suit Myriad Races&#39; settlement, the cosmos gains a resident that can tune its own rules. The macro-scale version of the Law Realm once again confirms: laws are not the strongman&#39;s private property, but public tools co-built by Myriad Races.</p><p>Star-core Dao establishment must be &quot;ecology first&quot;; this principle, amplified to the cosmic scale, means: any powerful cultivator&#39;s Dao cannot override the interests of all beings. Planets are thus, and individuals too — the legitimacy of a Dao always comes from how many lives it nurtures, not how many it crushes.</p><p>The Dao is born of nurturing, not of crushing; this principle is verified at the planetary scale and remembered at the individual scale.</p><p>In the final analysis, the Law Realm planetary life and cosmic being promotion described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview</a> · <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./24-锚点能量传导路径.html">24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path</a> · <a href="./53-奇特生命识别标准.html">53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=a(o,[["render",l]]);export{f as __pageData,g as default};
